WEBVTT

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.720
Man: Hey! Hey! Hey, get away from --

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:13.736
JJ Abrams: 10 years ago,
if we wanted to do that,

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.176
we'd have to kill a stuntman.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:20.256
(Laughter)

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:22.216
It would be harder.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.576
Take two would be a bitch.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:24.856
(Laughter)

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:27.976
So the amazing thing was,
we were able to do this thing.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.856
And part of that was
the amazing availability of technology,